{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1000_029umi", "source_sha256": "e55a2c2cbcd7da24d35b67c4339b10f6027cb35887df7ae01ffb39fe4660945c", "ja": "見て見てー！　{$P$}！\n私、白雪姫になっちゃった！　どう、似合ってる！？", "zh": "快看快看——！　{$P$}！\n我变成白雪公主了！　怎么样，好看吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1001_p", "source_sha256": "86a1aef284dc60087cc24f4fb9cfb9fc0e8fa598c96d28adbc448908f0db4a7d", "ja": "おお、いいじゃないか。お姫様みたいに可愛くて、\nみんなから愛されそうな雰囲気があるな。", "zh": "哦，很不错嘛。像公主一样可爱，感觉会很受大家喜爱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "22c5cf384ec81163642d0b77b47790542b138c168996a22691f1ad81ecc0733a", "ja": "そう？　やったー！　やっぱりさ、\n一度くらいは、童話のお姫様になってみたいよねー。", "zh": "是吗？太好了！果然啊，至少也想有一次，变成童话里的公主呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "24ad635c76eef42ecaf6fb96be7e323564739e445632ff2218e922f7c96b7dad", "ja": "私も憧れたな～。白雪姫にシンデレラ……\n眠れる森の美女とか、くるみ割り人形とか……。", "zh": "我也憧憬过呢～白雪公主、灰姑娘……\n还有睡美人、胡桃夹子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c5f25f693518c84677d79583cc1ee2c2d61c2398a9cc484ab5a317cae1ecca4e", "ja": "くるみ割り人形にお姫様はいないと思ったけど……。", "zh": "我记得《胡桃夹子》里好像没有公主吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "5ce34357b02bf8c98cd1048815ac37c463e08387ddcf5bf4de8d5d1b2d788918", "ja": "あっ、そっか。えへへ！　バレエを踊るお姉ちゃんを\n見て、お姫様みたいだなって思ってたから……。", "zh": "啊，原来是这样。嘿嘿！因为看到跳芭蕾舞的姐姐，觉得她像公主一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "a816de0cc64fcdc77caf6db7f6813e467cdca427e30b9ea6f1cb0802b3fcda98", "ja": "なんか、バレエの演目と混ざっちゃった。", "zh": "感觉和芭蕾舞剧的内容混在一起了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1123e85a390c47bcb97d51b85cc7330dba657e1547dcbc77476fefc51cd1e087", "ja": "たしかにバレエは、童話を題材にした演目が多いよな。\nお姫様が出てくる話も多い気がするし。", "zh": "确实，芭蕾舞剧里有很多以童话为题材的作品。\n而且感觉有不少故事里都会出现公主。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "43a62937678e968853ad0d681ef4a8da0005156eb4b86dff9be3900aab26936d", "ja": "そうなの！　私にとってのお姫様のイメージって、\nステージの上で一番輝いてる人なんだよね……。", "zh": "就是这样！对我来说，公主的形象就是在舞台上闪耀得最耀眼的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1009_p", "source_sha256": "19d9dfe88968ab5c21386320de6e5523c63ab9a338430e2bc322246061cbe488", "ja": "そうか。だから海美にとっては、\nお姉さんがお姫様なんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。所以对海美来说，姐姐就是公主啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "594bb9409f962935b490d6ff1844fbb4a443ec36b373d77997d1650696d3fe49", "ja": "はっ、そうかも！？　な、なんだか恥ずかしいなぁ。\n無意識でもお姉ちゃんが大好きみたいで……。", "zh": "啊，说不定真是这样！？总、总觉得有点不好意思呢。\n看来即使是无意识中，我也很喜欢姐姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a61a27c1ffac11974414a1ed674e0643cc1a1885decc2f183d3556dd2a5604c4", "ja": "ははっ、いいじゃないか。お姉さんのことが好きで\n憧れてるのは、本当なんだから。", "zh": "哈哈，这不是挺好吗？你喜欢姐姐、憧憬姐姐，这可是事实啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "c782530d9567ca356a5e53f626d4e6892efc0e98e263b213f45a2d671ac0ad98", "ja": "うう、そうだけど……。これじゃ、白雪姫じゃなくて、\n美しさに嫉妬しちゃう王妃様みたいじゃない？", "zh": "呜呜，是这样没错……可这样一来，不就不像白雪公主，反倒像是嫉妒美貌的王后了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "508ce53df6e1dfc4c38ed06cb6c8dd0e9b626422611991ff710481a3fd535eeb", "ja": "私、お姉ちゃんが世界で一番キレイだと思うんだ！\nバレエを踊ってる時は、すっごくキラキラしてるの。", "zh": "我觉得姐姐是世界上最漂亮的人！\n她跳芭蕾的时候，真的闪闪发光呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "e4371c1bb4741f4d84b70f88036a20dc4210b1ab4983bd834ab9c09b29ef29d0", "ja": "だから嫉妬とかは無いんだけど……。", "zh": "所以我并不会嫉妒什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3a90127c16edad8540aad854f7933d990d4d3c190fda4fdaa56acb8c0dca6e75", "ja": "ああ、わかってるよ。だから今度は海美が\nお姉さんを目指して、輝く番だと思うんだ。", "zh": "啊，我明白的。所以这次该轮到海美以姐姐为目标，绽放光芒了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7de5598f23d7790c1d4abb87de06d5ef59289641bb58485976385d1fb6d6f80c", "ja": "海美ならきっと、世界で一番の白雪姫になれる！", "zh": "海美一定能成为世界第一的白雪公主！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "f171d47fb49c06eaf3195d05365f368373ca63291daf50d4b2347aa7c505c342", "ja": "え、ええ～っ！　やめてよ～、恥ずかしいからぁ！\n世界で一番って……顔が赤くなっちゃうよ～！", "zh": "诶、诶诶～！别说了啦～，人家会害羞的！\n世界第一什么的……脸都要红了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ef97b2dbf745d3e8ac05ac25515ea9c43b21bf3923c5a74ba401a5b2c3029dbb", "ja": "海美のことをプロデュースしてきたんだ。\n海美なら出来るって、信じてるよ。", "zh": "我一直负责制作海美。  \n我相信海美一定能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "10a5cd94f1426907f88006428b5e184af5d9b54218d566802418d36ba790c55d", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nそうだよね……。私、白雪姫だもんね。", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n是啊……我可是白雪公主嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "51b34d42b43b903935ffbc858c7c6c6346c882f4a37bc74b30d3a0d332a1b1ac", "ja": "世界で一番の……私にしかできない白雪姫を……！\nよーし、やるぞー！", "zh": "世界第一的……只有我才能演绎的白雪姬……！\n好——要上了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "fb48d3de8c88e713393b279a8739ff9dac220937902ef1b4428b26de3c9b2797", "ja": "目指せ！　お姉ちゃんみたいにキレイな白雪姫！\n{$P$}もいっぱい応援してねっ♪", "zh": "目标是成为像姐姐一样美丽的白雪公主！\n{$P$}也要多多为我加油哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0584_1022_p", "source_sha256": "2303f5c45e8e43e47f0a8ea574de41f27c0f6d195b7fd1991728090b6b82bbbc", "ja": "（海美の魅力である、素直で前向きなところを活かせば\n……世界一の白雪姫も夢じゃないかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（如果发挥海美率真又积极的优点……说不定成为世界第一的白雪公主也不再是梦想了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
